85
00:06:14,740 --> 00:06:19,540
So viel Reiseliteratur

86
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:22,420
Oh, hallo Nodoka-Senpai

87
00:06:22,420 --> 00:06:24,780
Ach, du bist es

88
